{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The battlefield, native animation clips, and synthesized radio/audio are working. WebGPU and WebGL checks have passed for the art, and the network layer has passed its transport tests. I’m now connecting the full mission, menus, and controls, then testing the sortie from launch through evacuation.\n"}}
